# Two misspellings in magic.c, seen by Cherub (52), who watches. Smokegod (60, with holylight on, so he sees the
# invisible) makes Decimus (10) invisible, and
# casts cancellation at him, then again with dispel magic: "Decimus fades into existence." (stock said
# "existance", #76). Then Smokegod enchants a sword (3021) until it explodes: Cherub sees "A small sword shivers
# violently and explodes!" (stock said "explodeds").
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
